      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Reference class and base rate: for this level/rate series I use recent same-variant BLS seasonally adjusted Total quits-rate values as the base rate, because the target is also SA Total first print. The latest official rate is 1.9, and the contiguous Jan-May 2026 values are 2.0, 1.9, 2.0, 1.9, 1.9, with no evidence in the fetched data of a break away from roughly 2.0."
